  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until the onion is translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the carrots and cook for 2 minutes, until slightly tender.",
    "Add the snow peas and cook for an additional 2 minutes, until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the cashew nuts, coconut milk, fish sauce, soy sauce, and lime juice.",
    "Bring to a simmer and cook for 2-3 minutes, until the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "Stir in the chopped cashew nuts and season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve the dish hot over steamed rice or noodles."
